\pard\ql\f0\fs24\sl276\slmult1\sa100 M\u7909?c ti\u234?u c\u7911?a \u273?\u7873? t\u224?i l\u224? x\u226?y d\u7921?ng quy tr\u236?nh d\u7919? li\u7879?u v\u224? th\u7921?c nghi\u7879?m c\u243? th\u7875? t\u225?i l\u7853?p, ph\u226?n t\u237?ch k\u7871?t qu\u7843? tr\u234?n d\u7919? li\u7879?u m\u7845?t c\u226?n b\u7857?ng v\u224? ch\u7881? ra gi\u7899?i h\u7841?n c\u7911?a m\u244? h\u236?nh. Hi\u7879?n quy tr\u236?nh \u273?\u227? ch\u7841?y th\u7917? th\u224?nh c\u244?ng; ch\u7845?t l\u432?\u7907?ng d\u7921? \u273?o\u225?n sau hu\u7845?n luy\u7879?n \u273?\u7847?y \u273?\u7911? v\u7851?n c\u7847?n \u273?\u432?\u7907?c \u273?\u225?nh gi\u225?.\par
