\pard\ql\f0\fs24\sl276\slmult1\sa100 Em ch\u7885?n h\u432?\u7899?ng s\u7917? d\u7909?ng c\u7845?u tr\u250?c ph\u226?n t\u7917? v\u236? d\u7919? li\u7879?u hi\u7879?n c\u243? ch\u7913?a SMILES c\u7911?a t\u7915?ng thu\u7889?c v\u224? nh\u227?n t\u432?\u417?ng t\u225?c c\u7911?a c\u7863?p thu\u7889?c. Fingerprint gi\u250?p chuy\u7875?n c\u7845?u tr\u250?c ph\u226?n t\u7917? th\u224?nh \u273?\u7847?u v\u224?o s\u7889? c\u243? k\u237?ch th\u432?\u7899?c c\u7889? \u273?\u7883?nh \u273?\u7875? tri\u7875?n khai th\u7921?c nghi\u7879?m. S\u7843?n ph\u7849?m h\u432?\u7899?ng \u273?\u7871?n m\u7897?t m\u244? h\u236?nh nghi\u234?n c\u7913?u v\u224? ch\u432?\u417?ng tr\u236?nh minh h\u7885?a d\u7921? \u273?o\u225?n, kh\u244?ng ph\u7843?i c\u244?ng c\u7909? quy\u7871?t \u273?\u7883?nh d\u249?ng thu\u7889?c trong th\u7921?c t\u7871?.\par
