\pard\ql\f0\fs24\sl276\slmult1\sa100 2. Hu\u7845?n luy\u7879?n CNN\u8211?BiLSTM v\u224? so s\u225?nh v\u7899?i MLP s\u7917? d\u7909?ng c\u249?ng \u273?\u7847?u v\u224?o fingerprint.\par
\pard\ql\f0\fs24\sl276\slmult1\sa100 3. \u272?\u225?nh gi\u225? t\u7893?ng th\u7875? v\u224? theo t\u7915?ng l\u7899?p, ph\u226?n t\u237?ch c\u225?c l\u7899?p d\u7877? nh\u7847?m v\u224? l\u432?u m\u244? h\u236?nh \u273?\u7875? d\u7921? \u273?o\u225?n l\u7841?i m\u224? kh\u244?ng c\u7847?n hu\u7845?n luy\u7879?n m\u7895?i l\u7847?n.\par
